From: Ryan Adams <adamsrnmsu@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 22:24:47 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(waterway-arm64): add arm64 waterway topology with
 Linux SCADA stack

Static topology, scenario and injects for the waterway lock model on arm64
hosts. Windows roles (OPC TOP Server, mySCADA, Wonderware, Win7 HMI and
engineer workstation) are replaced by a Python OPC UA gateway, FUXA,
InfluxDB/Telegraf and xfce desktops. The aarch64 simulinksolver binary is
not included; the README says how to build it.
